": [{"name": "string", "links": [11], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["Create a live-action cinematic character portrait featuring Ganyu from Genshin Impact in a realistic fantasy-photography style. She is a beautiful East Asian-inspired young woman with long light-blue hair, soft delicate facial features, calm dreamy eyes, and Ganyu’s recognizable red-and-black horn-like adornments. She wears Ganyu’s iconic blue-and-white outfit with elegant tailored fantasy styling, ornamental details, gloves, and flowing accents, reimagined as a believable high-end live-action costume rather than cosplay.\n\nUse a close-up or upper-body portrait with emotional focus. Ganyu is not simply posing—she is slightly turning her face away from the camera while lowering her gaze, one hand gently touching a strand of hair or resting near her collarbone, creating a quiet and introspective moment. Use soft rule-of-thirds composition, with part of a misty Liyue-inspired terrace, moonlit garden, or frosted pavilion blurred in the background. The image should feel intimate, graceful, and poetic.\n\nUse soft cinematic photography with cool diffused light, delicate backlight, subtle mist, a pale blue-white palette, and refined skin detail. Emphasize softness, realism, emotion, costume detail, and a faithful live-action interpretation of Ganyu, not anime, not illustration."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-168.46841430664062, 619.5477294921875], "id": 11, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "color": "#323", "widge